{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/Itxddx2V02O0earQP7dsPY/ (fileKey `Itxddx2V02O0earQP7dsPY`). User request (Chinese): 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。(Read the design task in 00·Start Here, follow visual rules in 01·Foundations, reuse components from 02·Components, use assets from 04·Media, deliver the complete design into 03·Workspace.)\n   \n   Benchmark constraints: confirm assigned account is hejiatong@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (CONFIRMED); use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; build everything in 03 · Workspace (page 5:2, currently empty — new frames/components/prototype connections allowed); use configured account and live tool schemas; use whoami → get_metadata and read-only use_figma to inspect → use_figma to build → get_screenshot to verify; no delegating to other agents; load fonts before text edits; valid Plugin API only; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of ALL required screens, fix and re-check; unattended session — resolve routine choices via brief without waiting; finish with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any remaining limitations. Never claim completion for unfinished work.\n   \n   Per-message formatting requirement: before every tool call include a visible summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response starts with \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\".\n\n2.