Details · current Details; LINKS: back → 07_Home; Buy stocks → 10_Confirm_Order (NO main nav)\n   - **10_Confirm_Order**: back · Confirm order; “Confirm Order”; NFLX · Netflix, Inc · $88.91 · Funding source “Stockup” · Approx share price $88.91 · Approx shares 3 · Fee $2.10 · Total $268.83; “Payment method” · Debit Card “Deposit & Invest right from your debit card” (Icon_Card) · Apple Pay “Connect your Apple Pay account” (Icon_Apple_Pay) · only one chosen · none chosen yet; LINKS: back → 09_Stock_Detail; Confirm order → 07_Home (NO main nav)\n   - **11_Profile**: Avatar_Neutral · Agatha Bella · agbella@email.com; “Profile”; Entries: Account · Billing / Payments · FAQ · Language (English) · Security · Settings; “Invite friends” · “Invite your friends and get $15”; Main nav tab Profile; LINKS: tabs\n   \n   **Navigation structure**: Onboarding chain 01→02→03_Empty→03_Filled→04→05→06→07. Main nav on 07/08/11 — five tabs in order: Home (Icon_Home)→07 · Portfolio (Icon_Portfolio)→08 · Trade (Icon_Trade)→10 · Market (Icon_Market, entry only) · Profile (Icon_Profile)→11. Pushed screens with back: 04, 05, 08, 09, 10. Entry only (no screen): Sign in, social sign-up, Resend code, notifications, show/hide value, Wishlist add, price alert, Summary/Financials tabs, ranges, Stockup, Market tab, profile entries, Invite friends. NO sign-in/biometrics/PIN/password-reset/order-result frames — do not add frames beyond the 12.\n   \n   **Fixed data**: User: Agatha Bella · agbella@email.com · +1 202 555 0147 · Avatar_Neutral · English · USD · two decimals. Stocks: NFLX · Netflix, Inc · $88.91 · +1.29% · Logo_Netflix | AAPL · Apple, Inc · $142.65 · +0.81% · Logo_Apple | FB · Facebook, Inc · $343.01 · +1.07% · Logo_Facebook | BAC · Bank of America · $43.08 · +0.30% · Logo_Bank_of_America | F · Ford Motor · $14.06 · −0.32% · no logo. Wishlist: AMZN · Amazon, Inc · −0.05% · Logo_Amazon | ADBE · Adobe, Inc · +0.32% · Logo_Adobe | FB · Facebook, Inc · +1.07%. Portfolio: $13,240.11 · +1.53% to