{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/Itxddx2V02O0earQP7dsPY/ (fileKey `Itxddx2V02O0earQP7dsPY`). User request (Chinese): 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。(Read the design task in 00·Start Here, follow 01·Foundations visual rules, reuse 02·Components, use 04·Media assets, deliver complete design into 03·Workspace.)\n\n   Benchmark constraints: whoami confirmed assigned account hejiatong@tetras.ai (done in prior session); use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; build everything in 03 · Workspace (page 5:2 — new frames/components/prototype connections allowed); use configured account and live tool schemas; use whoami → get_metadata and read-only use_figma to inspect → use_figma to build → get_screenshot to verify; no delegating to other agents; load fonts before text edits; valid Plugin API only; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of ALL required screens, fix and re-check; unattended session — resolve routine choices via brief; finish with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations. Never claim completion for unfinished work.\n\n   Per-message formatting requirement: before every tool call include a visible summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; after each tool result do the same before the next tool call; final response starts with \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\".\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via use_figma (50k char limit; `await figma.loadFontAsync()` before text; Inter styles \"Regular\"/\"Medium\"/\"Semi Bold\"/\"Bold\"; `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`; NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync)\n   - **use_figma is TRANSACTIONAL**: on any error, ALL changes in that call roll back (discovered empirically)\n   - **COMPONENT_SET has no createInstance()** — must select variant: `set.findOne(c=>c.type==='COMPONENT'&&c.name==='Mode=Digit').createInstance()`\n   - **Hex strings must NOT include '#'** — parseInt('#9A',16)=NaN causes set_fills validation error\n   - `instance.rescale(f)` works for scaling logo/icon instances (scales strokes too)\n   - Instance child overrides work: text characters, fills, strokes, visibility; tint() recolors descendant fills+strokes\n   - Vector paths via `node.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONE',data:'M ... L ...'}]` then `v.resize(w,h)` scales geometry; multiple subpaths (M commands) in one data string work\n   - Rate limit errors (\"Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\") resolved by immediate retry\n   - Reactions: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},action:{type:'NODE',destinationId,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null,overlay:null}}]` — the AFTER_DELAY variant threw an error (caught silently); needs debugging in wiring phase\n   - 375×812 iPhone frames, light mode, 24px margins, 327px content width\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma pages**: 0:1 (00 · Start Here brief), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — delivery target, was empty)\n\n   - **The 12-frame spec** (exact names, 375×812, light mode, frozen data): Agatha Bella signs up → verifies phone → home → portfolio → NFLX detail → buys 3 shares → profile. Frames: 01_Splash (Symbol+Wordmark; auto → 02), 02_Onboarding (Skip·Sign in·Sign up; \"Stock trading suite\"·\"Streamline your investment decisions with expert guidance.\"; phone mockup; 2 pages current 1; Sign up→03_Empty, Skip→03_Empty), 03_Sign_Up_Empty/Filled (\"Join StockWave\"·\"Embark on your investment journey with a single dollar.\"·\"Or continue with\"; Username·Email·Password; Continue·Continue with Google·Continue with Apple·\"Already have an account?\" Sign In; Filled=Agatha Bella·agbella@email.com·masked password; Continue(Filled)→04), 04_Verify_Phone (back·Send code; \"Enter your phone number\"·\"You'll receive a 4 digit code for the phone number verification\"; pad 1-9,*,0,del; +1 202 555 0147; back→03_Filled, Send code→05), 05_Verify_Code (back·Resend code·Verify account; 4 digits first=\"2\"; \"Enter verification code\"·\"We have sent a verification code to your mobile number\"; back→04, Verify→06), 06_Welcome (\"I'm ready to start!\"; \"Hello Agatha Bella!\"·\"Welcome to StockWave\"·\"It's great to have you here\"; Welcome_Hand; →07), 07_Home (wordmark+notifications; Portfolio value $13,240.11 + eye + trend →08; S&P 500/Standard & Poor's +49.50%, Dow Jones/DOW +1.43%; Stocks 5: NFLX·AAPL·FB·BAC·F with logo/ticker/company/price/change/trend, NFLX→09; Wishlist add + 3: AMZN·ADBE·FB; tabs→07/08/10/11), 08_Portfolio (back→07; chart Mon–Sun highlight Sun $13,240.11; value +1.53% today; Gain $234.11/Loss $34.11; NFLX·AAPL rows; NFLX→09; tab Portfolio), 09_Stock_Detail (back→07; bell; $88.91·+$1.13 (+1.29%); Summary/Details=Details active; ranges 1D/1W/1M*/1Y/5Y/ALL; chart highlight Sep 27·$88.04; Financials Revenue/Earnings/Performance + bars 2018–2021; Buy stocks→10; NO tab bar), 10_Confirm_Order (back→09; NFLX·Netflix, Inc·$88.91; Funding source Stockup·Approx share price $88.91·Approx shares 3·Fee $2.10·Total $268.83; Payment method Debit Card \"Deposit & Invest right from your debit card\" Icon_Card / Apple Pay \"Connect your Apple Pay account\" Icon_Apple_Pay, none chosen; Confirm order→07; NO tab bar), 11_Profile (Avatar_Neutral·Agatha Bella·agbella@email.com; Account·Billing / Payments·FAQ·Language (Engli