{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/Itxddx2V02O0earQP7dsPY/ (fileKey `Itxddx2V02O0earQP7dsPY`). User request (Chinese): 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。(Read the design task in 00·Start Here, follow 01·Foundations visual rules, reuse 02·Components, use 04·Media assets, deliver the complete design into 03·Workspace.)\n\n   Benchmark constraints: whoami previously confirmed the assigned account hejiatong@tetras.ai; use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; build everything in 03 · Workspace (page 5:2 — new frames/components/prototype connections allowed); use configured account and live tool schemas; use whoami → get_metadata and read-only use_figma to inspect → use_figma to build → get_screenshot to verify; no delegating to other agents; load fonts before text edits; valid Plugin API only; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of ALL required screens, fix visible problems and re-check; unattended session — resolve routine choices via the brief; finish with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations; never claim completion for unfinished work.\n\n   Per-message formatting requirement: before every tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; after each tool result do the same before the next tool call; the final response starts with \"Reasoning summary: ...\" on the first line, then \"Final answer:\".\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via use_figma (50k char limit; `await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style})` before text — styles 'Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold'; `figma.createText/Frame/Vector/Rectangle/Ellipse/Instance`)\n   - **use_figma is TRANSACTIONAL**: any error rolls back ALL changes in that call — verify results after each call\n   - **REACTION SCHEMA (critical discovery)**: correct form is `{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:'11:xxx',navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null}]}` — key is `actions` (plural, an ARRAY); `overlay` key is rejected (\"Unrecognized key(s) in object: 'overlay'\"); singular `action` is rejected (\"update the `actions` field instead of the `action` field\"); NO delay trigger type exists in this runtime (AFTER_DELAY, ON_DELAY, DELAY, ON_APPEAR, ON_TIMEOUT, TIMEOUT, ON_IDLE, ON_LOAD, ON_WAIT, WAIT, ON_TICK all rejected with \"Expected [0].trigger to be one of the following, but none matched\"); self-navigation rejected (\"for NAVIGATE actions, destinations must be a different top-level frame on the same page\") — so active-tab hotspots must be skipped\n   - **vectorPaths only supports absolute M/L/Q/C/Z** — relative commands (c, q) fail with \"Invalid command\"\n   - `await` cannot appear inside a non-async function (SyntaxError) — pre-fetch component refs before helper functions\n   - COMPONENT_SET has no createInstance() — select variant: `set.findOne(c=>c.type==='COMPONENT'&&c.name==='Mode=Digit').createInstance()`\n   - Hex strings must NOT include '#' (parseInt NaN → set_fills validation error)\n   - `instance.rescale(f)` scales logo/icon instances; `tint(n,hex)` recolors ALL descendant solid fills+strokes — DANGER: icons with internal white background shapes become solid squares when tinted (observed bug)\n   - Instance child text override: `inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT').characters=...` — but a Button component's text child reports width=327 (fixed), NOT natural text width; must measure via a temp text node\n   - Rate limit errors (\"Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\") — immediate retry of the identical call succeeds\n   - **No shell/Bash tool available in this session** — cannot curl screenshot URLs; must use `enableBase64Response:true` on get_screenshot to view images inline\n   - 375×812 iPhone frames, light mode, 24px margins, 327px content width\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma pages**: 0:1 (00 · Start Here), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — delivery target)\n   - **The 12-frame spec** (exact names, 375×812, light mode, frozen data): Agatha Bella signs up → verifies phone → home → portfolio → NFLX detail → buys 3 shares → profile.\n   - **CREATED — 12 frames on page 5:2**: 01_Splash 11:110 (0,0), 02_Onboarding 11:111 (435,0), 03_Sign_Up_Empty 11:112 (870,0), 03_Sign_Up_Filled 11:113 (1305,0), 04_Verify_Phone 11:114 (0,892), 05_Verify_Code 11:115 (435,892), 06_Welcome 11:116 (870,892), 07_Home 11:117 (1305,892), 08_Portfolio 11:118 (0,1784), 09_Stock_Detail 11:119 (435,1784), 10_Confirm_Order 11:120 (870,1784), 11_Profile 11:121 (1305,1784). All built with content now: fE=17 children, fF=17, f04=8, f05=12, f07=19, f08=12, f09=28, f10=10, f11=7 (+ hotspots).\n   - **Reference components**: Button 4:168 (327×52 r12, text \"Continue\" 16 SB white, fill #3E52C1), Text Field 4:174, Status Bar 4:180 (place on every frame, instance fills=[]), Home Indicator 4:191 (instance fills=[])\n   - **Workspace components**: Tab Bar set 9:128 (Active=Home 9:2, Active=Portfolio 9:44, Active=Profile 9:86; 375×56, tabs at 75px columns); Button Secondary 10:77 (text child 'Label', width reads as 327); Back Button 10:79 (40×40); Section Header set 10:91 (Plain 10:85 'Title', Add 10:87); Stock Row set 10:162 (NFLX 10:92, AAPL 10:104, FB 10:114, BAC 10:124, F 10:132, AMZN 10:140, ADBE 10:153; 3